[
  // Fletching makes *parts*: shafts, staves, strings, heads, vanes. The finished bow or the
  // finished projectile is assembled by the fabrication forms system from these components, so
  // the interesting differences come from which materials went in — exactly as they do for a
  // sword. There is deliberately no second combat-stat crafting path here
  // (docs/professions.md §14). Bow and projectile forms land with the form-acquisition pass.
